# data-platform/.gitignore excludes app/public/data/* because the pipeline
# generates those files. The published, quality-gated dataset is also a deploy
# artifact for GitHub Pages: a plain `git clone` must produce a working site
# without running the Python pipeline first. Re-include the small JSON files
# here (a deeper .gitignore wins over the parent rule).
!public/data/
!public/data/*.json
!public/data/*.geojson

# Local-only validation artifacts
_shots/
_syntax/
